        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert, mildly agitated, speaking in full sentences, and in no apparent distress."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shin wound"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Superficial laceration on the anterior right shin approximately 5 cm below the knee, about 2.5 cm long, following a knock against a metal platform at work approximately 10 days ago. Surrounding erythema extends about 3–4 cm beyond the wound; area is warm and tender with mild induration and a small amount of purulent exudate on the dressing. No fluctuance, crepitus, necrosis, bullae, or lymphangitic streaking."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right inguinal node examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild right inguinal node tenderness."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right lower leg examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Calf soft and non-tender, with no asymmetric swelling. Pulses intact, capillary refill under 2 seconds, and sensation intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cardiovascular examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Dual heart sounds; no murmur."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Respiratory examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Chest clear with good air entry."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported right leg symptoms and functional impact"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports increased redness, tenderness, and yellow ooze from the wound over the last 3–4 days; feeling off and more tired; and increased right leg pain and swelling over the past few days, with a mild limp due to pain and reduced tolerance for prolonged walking, standing, and heavy work."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Systemic symptoms and toxicity assessment"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies rigors, chest pain, shortness of breath, abdominal pain, nausea, and vomiting. No clinical features of systemic toxicity or SIRS currently."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Exposure history relevant to wound"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies recent overseas travel, animal or human bites, and fresh or salt water exposure. Reports daily showering and occasionally hosing the leg at work."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Patient's attribution of wound infection"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient believes the infection may be due to chemicals at work and that water at home, which he says smells funny, may have poisoned the wound."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
