        "id": "observation-18",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Work capacity"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Temporary reduced capacity for prolonged standing, walking, heavy outdoor work, and physically demanding work until the infection resolves. The form noted a need for ready access to medical review if deterioration occurs."
      }
    },
    {
